On falling below 0 life, you engage an automated repair mode. While in this mode you cannot act, but can survive below [-50, -251, -405, -535, -650 (TL1-5)] life, heal for [10, 43, 69, 90, 110 (TL1-5)] life each turn and have all resistances increased by [5%, 17%, 25%, 30%, 34% (TL1-5)]. This will last until you are destroyed or until you are fully healed.

This effect has a cooldown.
